<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<nc_page xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" version="1.2.1" xmlns="http://www.nintendo.co.jp/sdd/2010/page">
  <head>
    <create user="" host="" date="2026-11-03T22:56:29.8293395+00:00" source="" />
    <title />
    <comment />
    <generator name="NW4C ManualEditor Core" version="1.2.0.1" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <ncpg>
      <header>The Crewmate Role</header>
      <category>The Roles</category>
      <paneSet>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_00">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="10" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="140" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.666666" y="20" />
            <text>Your main goal is simple: fill the green task bar at the top left of the screen by finishing your assignments, or survive long enough to vote out all the Impostors. Use your personal map to track down glowing yellow task markers across the ship.</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_00" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
        <pane kind="TextBox" name="TextBox_01">
          <basePositionType x="Left" y="Top" />
          <translate x="8" y="160" z="0" />
          <rotate x="0" y="0" z="0" />
          <scale x="1" y="1" />
          <size x="304" y="200" />
          <textBox font="cbf_std" autoWidthAdjust="true">
            <fontSize x="16.666666" y="20" />
            <text>When things get critical (like an O2 failure or a reactor meltdown) red warning arrows will point you straight to the problem. Drop what you're doing and fix it before the countdown hits zero, or it's game over. Even if an Impostor catches you early, you become a ghost who can still phase through walls and finish tasks.</text>
            <topColor r="0" g="0" b="0" a="255" />
            <bottomColor r="60" g="60" b="60" a="255" />
            <positionType x="Left" y="Top" />
            <material name="TextBox_01" />
            <texEnabled>false</texEnabled>
            <texLayoutPosition>LeftTop</texLayoutPosition>
            <texOffsetLeft>0</texOffsetLeft>
            <texOffsetRight>0</texOffsetRight>
            <texOffsetTop>0</texOffsetTop>
            <texOffsetBottom>0</texOffsetBottom>
          </textBox>
        </pane>
      </paneSet>
      <paneHierarchy>
        <paneTree name="RootPane">
          <paneTree name="TextBox_00" />
          <paneTree name="TextBox_01" />
        </paneTree>
      </paneHierarchy>
      <screenSetting origin="Normal">
        <layoutSize x="320" y="370" />
        <screenBottomMargin>10</screenBottomMargin>
        <backGround>
          <color r="255" g="255" b="255" a="255" />
        </backGround>
        <stereo parallaxRatio="0.6" />
        <grid thickLineInterval="32" thinDivisionNum="4" visible="true" moveMethod="Grid">
          <color r="128" g="128" b="64" a="128" />
        </grid>
        <guide visible="false" snapEnalbed="false">
          <position x="0" y="0" />
          <size x="8" y="8" />
          <color r="0" g="128" b="0" a="64" />
        </guide>
        <maxEqualCharSpace>2</maxEqualCharSpace>
        <textBoxCounter>2</textBoxCounter>
      </screenSetting>
      <fontFile path="cbf_std.bcfnt" />
    </ncpg>
  </body>
</nc_page>